Grammar

    0 $accept: file $end

    1 file: file VAR_START1 VAR_START2 VARIABLE VAR_END
    2     | file ANY
    3     | ε


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    ANY <vstring> (258) 2
    VARIABLE <vstring> (259) 1
    VAR_START1 <vstring> (260) 1
    VAR_START2 <vstring> (261) 1
    VAR_END <vstring> (262) 1


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (8)
        on left: 0
    file <varray> (9)
        on left: 1 2 3
        on right: 0 1 2


State 0

    0 $accept: • file $end

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (file)

    file  go to state 1


State 1

    0 $accept: file • $end
    1 file: file • VAR_START1 VAR_START2 VARIABLE VAR_END
    2     | file • ANY

    $end        shift, and go to state 2
    ANY         shift, and go to state 3
    VAR_START1  shift, and go to state 4


State 2

    0 $accept: file $end •

    $default  accept


State 3

    2 file: file ANY •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (file)


State 4

    1 file: file VAR_START1 • VAR_START2 VARIABLE VAR_END

    VAR_START2  shift, and go to state 5


State 5

    1 file: file VAR_START1 VAR_START2 • VARIABLE VAR_END

    VARIABLE  shift, and go to state 6


State 6

    1 file: file VAR_START1 VAR_START2 VARIABLE • VAR_END

    VAR_END  shift, and go to state 7


State 7

    1 file: file VAR_START1 VAR_START2 VARIABLE VAR_END •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (file)
